    "title": "Longest Well-Performing Interval",
    "category": "Sliding Window",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given an array where each element represents the number of hours worked in a day, determine the length of the longest contiguous interval where the number of tiring days (hours > 8) is strictly greater than the number of non-tiring days.",
